The THS327-ET Temperature Sensor is used to measure the temperature with a remote probe. It is available to measure the temperature of water, the air temperature around the probe and so on.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Temperature measuring with remote probe
- Probe sensing range: -30℃ ~ +100℃, ±1℃ accuracy
- 100~240 Vac powered, < 1W
- Low power consumption
